OL,3,GNEWSABus journeys in west of Scotland
OL,4,Ato be capped at #2 from Monday
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus fares in the west of Scotland will
OL,7,Fbe capped at #2, First Minister John
OL,8,FSwinney has announced.
OL,10,FThe move takes effect from Monday
OL,11,Fmorning for journeys in Glasgow,
OL,12,FRenfrewshire, Ayrshire, Dunbartonshire,
OL,13,FLanarkshire and Inverclyde.
OL,15,FIn his programme for government,
OL,16,FSwinney also confirmed plans to cut
OL,17,FScotland's health boards from 14 to two
OL,18,Fin what he said was the "most
OL,19,Fsignificant structural reform in the
OL,20,FNHS in the era of devolution".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
