OL,3,GNEWSABus journeys in west of Scotland
OL,4,Ato be capped at #2 from Monday
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe vowed that by 2031, no patient will
OL,7,Fwait longer than 26 weeks for the
OL,8,Ftreatment they need - an apparent
OL,9,Fdowngrade on a promise in 2011 that
OL,10,Fpatients should not wait longer than 12
OL,11,Fweeks for inpatient or day-case
OL,12,Ftreatment after diagnosis.
